ua4xwisHE1axP82M7zpMUFtpCC1lR7tjiw3Q&oe=6AA93D13"}, {"file_name": "Recording Radial Pulse Simulator_SS_05.png", "id": "837151848339615", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43931336_837151851672948_3791241212278429846_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AtIvPScVUh0Q7kNvwEAT-e4&_nc_oc=AdpiN8ztp6bwEI9B1l9b0yhIFaWPkx_4I5AOqrL1NURotyC-ylpJgO1p6SKSXf_pL-Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIfg5hn0FXE3kURPK4BhuWfJzZOMFVqFH4_a3T6HVV63Q&oe=6AA96867"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440.png", "id": "3812821238933502", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982527_3812821242266835_422188521434867194_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EtI_1ZjsYD0Q7kNvwEUVlhT&_nc_oc=AdocQFGNB7PfPQNcFQmgb7myQM81QVVOqPSi4IxEdY14uF6E3LIH2fjUX_Fb6PEhpUs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLhbyh-5V2fJc9QD28SCyBcJoW4P1NjH97ACvaA1z7YZw&oe=6AA94E4C"}, "display_name": "Recording Radial Pulse Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This tutorial covers the essential steps for measuring and recording a patient's radial pulse. It includes preparation, locating the pulse, measurement, and documentation. By the end of this tutorial, learners will be able to: \n\nRemember the key steps in recording a radial pulse. \n- Understand the significance of pulse measurement in patient assessment. \n- Apply the correct techniques to ensure accurate pulse recording. \n- Analyze pulse data to detect any irregularities. \n- Evaluate their measurement accuracy and identify areas for improvement. \n- Create precise and thorough patient records based on their findings. \n\nThis comprehensive approach ensures CNAs are well-prepared to assist patients with feeding efficiently and compassionately in real-world clinical settings. ", "short_description": "Develop proficiency in accurately recording a patient's radial pulse."}]}, "developer_nam